          "docs": "Create Data Stream to your destination.\nClick on Examples to see available Data Streams and configuration parameters.\n\nCurrently available `connection_types` are\n- `AwsKinesis`\n- `S3`\n- `RestAPI`\n- `KeenIO`\n- `Datadog`\n- `EventHubs`\n- `PubSub`\n"
